   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 03 - 语雀富格式元素测试\n",
    "\n",
    "> 测试目标：验证语雀 Lake HTML 支持的各种富格式元素是否能正确保存和渲染。\n",
    "> 测试方法：每种格式创建独立文档 → 读取验证内容 → 确认后删除。\n",
    "\n",
    "## 测试目录\n",
    "\n",
    "1. [环境准备](#环境准备)\n",
    "2. [标题与段落](#标题与段落)\n",
    "3. [无序列表与有序列表](#无序列表与有序列表)\n",
    "4. [行内格式：加粗、斜体、代码](#行内格式)\n",
    "5. [表格](#表格)\n",
    "6. [代码块](#代码块)\n",
    "7. [引用块](#引用块)\n",
    "8. [数学公式](#数学公式)\n",
    "9. [综合文档](#综合文档)\n",
    "10. [清理](#清理)\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 环境准备"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# =============================================================================\n",
    "# 环境准备\n",
    "# =============================================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "import os\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "from datetime import datetime\n",
    "\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    from dotenv import load_dotenv\n",
    "    load_dotenv(Path('../../.env'))\n",
    "except ImportError:\n",
    "    pass\n",
    "\n",
    "from yuque_client import YuqueClient, lake_html, lake_table, lake_code_block, lake_formula\n",
    "\n",
    "client = YuqueClient()\n",
    "print('✅ 客户端初始化成功')\n",
    "\n",
    "books = client.list_books()\n",
    "BOOK_ID = books[0]['id']\n",
    "print(f'📚 使用知识库: {books[0][\"name\"]} (ID={BOOK_ID})')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 记录所有测试文档，最后统一清理\n",
    "TEST_DOC_IDS = []"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# =============================================================================\n",
    "# 辅助函数：测试一种格式\n",
    "# =============================================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "def test_format(name, content_html, expected_texts):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    测试一种 Lake HTML 格式。\n",
    "    \n",
    "    流程：创建 → 读取 → 验证 → 记录 ID（最后统一删除）\n",
    "    \n",
    "    参数:\n",
    "        name: 测试名称\n",
    "        content_html: Lake HTML 内容\n",
    "        expected_texts: 读取后应该包含的文本列表\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    print(f'\\n{\"=\"*60}')\n",
    "    print(f'测试: {name}')\n",
    "    print(f'{\"=\"*60}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 创建\n",
    "    doc = client.create_doc(\n",
    "        book_id=BOOK_ID,\n",
    "        title=f'[富格式]{name}-{datetime.now().strftime(\"%H%M%S\")}',\n",
    "        content=content_html,\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if not doc:\n",
    "        print(f'❌ 创建失败')\n",
    "        return False\n",
    "    \n",
    "    doc_id = doc['id']\n",
    "    doc_slug = doc['slug']\n",
    "    TEST_DOC_IDS.append(doc_id)\n",
    "    print(f'✅ 创建成功: ID={doc_id}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 读取验证\n",
    "    read_doc = client.read_doc(BOOK_ID, doc_slug)\n",
    "    content = read_doc.get('content', '')\n",
    "    print(f'   内容长度: {len(content)} 字符')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    all_pass = True\n",
    "    for expected in expected_texts:\n",
    "        passed = expected in content\n",
    "        status = '✅' if passed else '❌'\n",
    "        print(f'   {status} 包含 \"{expected[:40]}\"')\n",
    "        if not passed:\n",
    "            all_pass = False\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if not all_pass:\n",
    "        print(f'   实际内容: {content[:300]}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    result = '✅ 通过' if all_pass else '❌ 失败'\n",
    "    print(f'\\n结果: {result} — {name}')\n",
    "    return all_pass"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 标题与段落\n",
    "\n",
    "测试 h1/h2/h3 标题和普通段落。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "test_format('标题与段落',\n",
    "    lake_html(\n",
    "        '<h1>一级标题</h1>',\n",
    "        '<h2>二级标题</h2>',\n",
    "        '<h3>三级标题</h3>',\n",
    "        '<p>普通段落文字。</p>',\n",
    "    ),\n",
    "    ['一级标题', '二级标题', '三级标题', '普通段落文字']\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 无序列表与有序列表"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "test_format('列表',\n",
    "    lake_html(\n",
    "        '<ul><li>无序项 A</li><li>无序项 B</li></ul>',\n",
    "        '<ol><li>有序项 1</li><li>有序项 2</li></ol>',\n",
    "    ),\n",
    "    ['无序项 A', '无序项 B', '有序项 1', '有序项 2']\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 行内格式\n",
    "\n",
    "测试加粗、斜体、行内代码。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "test_format('行内格式',\n",
    "    lake_html(\n",
    "        '<p>普通文字 <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">加粗文字</span> 普通文字</p>',\n",
    "        '<p>普通文字 <span style=\"font-style: italic\">斜体文字</span> 普通文字</p>',\n",
    "        '<p>行内代码: <code>print(hello)</code></p>',\n",
    "    ),\n",
    "    ['加粗文字', '斜体文字', 'print(hello)']\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 表格\n",
    "\n",
    "表格需要 `class=""lake-table""` 和 `<colgroup>`。\n",
    "使用 `lake_table()` 辅助函数生成。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "table_html = lake_table(\n",
    "    headers=['姓名', '年龄', '城市'],\n",
    "    rows=[['张三', '25', '北京'], ['李四', '30', '上海']],\n",
    "    col_widths=[200, 200, 200],\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "test_format('表格',\n",
    "    lake_html('<h1>表格测试</h1>', table_html),\n",
    "    ['姓名', '年龄', '城市', '张三', '李四', '北京', '上海']\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 代码块\n",
    "\n",
    "使用 `<pre><code class=""language-xxx"">...</code></pre>` 格式。\n",
    "使用 `lake_code_block()` 辅助函数生成。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "python_code = lake_code_block('python', 'def hello():\\n    print(\"Hello, World!\")\\n\\nhello()\\n')\n",
    "js_code = lake_code_block('javascript', 'const x = 1;\\nconsole.log(x);\\n')\n",
    "\n",
    "test_format('代码块',\n",
    "    lake_html('<h1>代码块测试</h1>', python_code, '<p>JS 代码:</p>', js_code),\n",
    "    ['def hello', 'Hello, World', 'const x', 'console.log']\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 引用块"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "test_format('引用块',\n",
    "    lake_html(\n",
    "        '<h1>引用测试</h1>',\n",
    "        '<blockquote><p><span>这是一段引用文字。</span></p></blockquote>',\n",
    "        '<p>正常段落。</p>',\n",
    "    ),\n",
    "    ['这是一段引用文字']\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 数学公式\n",
    "\n",
    "语雀 Lake HTML 使用 `data-latex` 属性存储公式源码。\n",
    "使用 `lake_formula()` 辅助函数生成。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "inline_formula = '<p>行内公式: ' + lake_formula('E = mc^2') + '</p>'\n",
    "display_formula = lake_formula('\\\\int_0^\\\\infty e^{-x} dx = 1', display=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "test_format('数学公式',\n",
    "    lake_html(\n",
    "        '<h1>公式测试</h1>',\n",
    "        inline_formula,\n",
    "        '<p>行间公式:</p>',\n",
    "        display_formula,\n",
    "    ),\n",
    "    ['data-latex', 'E = mc^2', 'int_0']\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 综合文档\n",
    "\n",
    "在一个文档中混合使用所有格式元素。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "mixed_content = lake_html(\n",
    "    '<meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" />',\n",
    "    '<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" />',\n",
    "    '<h1>综合测试文档</h1>',\n",
    "    '<p>本文档测试 <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">多种</span> 格式。</p>',\n",
    "    '<h2>1. 列表</h2>',\n",
    "    '<ul><li>特性 A</li><li>特性 B</li></ul>',\n",
    "    '<h2>2. 表格</h2>',\n",
    "    lake_table(['参数', '值'], [['学习率', '0.001'], ['批次大小', '32']], [200, 200]),\n",
    "    '<h2>3. 代码</h2>',\n",
    "    lake_code_block('python', 'import torch\\nmodel = torch.nn.Linear(10, 2)\\nprint(model)\\n'),\n",
    "    '<h2>4. 公式</h2>',\n",
    "    lake_formula('\\\\sigma(x)=\\\\frac{1}{1+e^{-x}}', display=True),\n",
    "    '<blockquote><p><span>注意：这是一个引用块。</span></p></blockquote>',\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "test_format('综合文档', mixed_content, [\n",
    "    '综合测试文档', '特性 A', '参数', '值', '学习率', '0.001',\n",
    "    'import torch', 'sigma(x)', '注意：这是一个引用块'\n",
    "])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 清理\n",
    "\n",
    "删除所有测试文档。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# =============================================================================\n",
    "# 清理所有测试文档\n",
    "# =============================================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'准备清理 {len(TEST_DOC_IDS)} 个测试文档...\\n')\n",
    "\n",
    "success = 0\n",
    "fail = 0\n",
    "for doc_id in TEST_DOC_IDS:\n",
    "    if client.delete_doc(doc_id, BOOK_ID):\n",
    "        print(f'✅ 已删除: {doc_id}')\n",
    "        success += 1\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        print(f'❌ 删除失败: {doc_id}')\n",
    "        fail += 1\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'\\n清理完成: {success} 成功, {fail} 失败')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 附录：Lake HTML 富格式速查表\n",
    "\n",
    "| 元素 | Lake HTML 格式 | 辅助函数 |\n",
    "|------|---------------|---------|\n",
    "| 标题 | `<h1>标题</h1>` | - |\n",
    "| 段落 | `<p>文字</p>` | - |\n",
    "| 无序列表 | `<ul><li>项</li></ul>` | - |\n",
    "| 有序列表 | `<ol><li>项</li></ol>` | - |\n",
    "| 加粗 | `<span style=\"font-weight: bold\">文字</span>` | - |\n",
    "| 斜体 | `<span style=\"font-style: italic\">文字</span>` | - |\n",
    "| 行内代码 | `<code>代码</code>` | - |\n",
    "| 表格 | `<table class=\"lake-table\">...</table>` | `lake_table()` |\n",
    "| 代码块 | `<pre><code class=\"language-xxx\">...</code></pre>` | `lake_code_block()` |\n",
    "| 公式 | `<span data-latex=\"...\">$$...$$</span>` | `lake_formula()` |\n",
    "| 引用 | `<blockquote><p><span>...</span></p></blockquote>` | - |"
   ]
  }
